Read-only index inventory. Requires --read-only, STAGING_MONGODB_URI, and STAGING_DATABASE_NAME.
Example: set STAGING_MONGODB_URI and STAGING_DATABASE_NAME, then run node src/scripts/checkToeicPart5IndexesStaging.js --read-only
This script only lists collections and indexes. It never creates indexes or changes database data.
Preconditions are missing; no database connection was attempted.
